  "$comment": "One list of cities drives both the gold tracker and city news. Users pick their city on first launch (the first city is pre-selected). For each city the build makes a news topic from Google News in English, Telugu and Tamil (searching the names in 'aliases', or the search words in 'q' when a name is also an ordinary word, like Erode) plus the region's feeds filtered to stories that mention the city. 'region': 'ap' / 'ts' (Telugu feeds) or 'tn' (Tamil Nadu & Puducherry, Tamil feeds). 'groww' = groww.in slug (gold, primary), 'gr' = goodreturns.in slug (gold, backup, optional), 'short' = short label for the tab bar, 'feeds' = extra feeds just for this city.",
